    {
      "catalogue_id": "AST-SAL-004",
      "readout": "Low open planting edge has a continuous tactile timber seat, three visible under-seat bearings, quieter teal recess and a shaped end perch. Final perch bearing now reaches floor. The useful seat surface and soil separation are legible at640\u00d7360. Original botanical002/003 reuse is disclosed; no new plant counted.",
